{"video_id": "fJuc4-G18nI", "segment_index": 24, "start_seconds": 85.19999694824219, "end_seconds": 89.12000274658203, "text": "We should start the video by explaining what we mean by the word ungovernable.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
