{"video_id": "fJuc4-G18nI", "segment_index": 27, "start_seconds": 95.5199966430664, "end_seconds": 100.63999938964844, "text": "This is to say, there are essentially core structural reasons preventing good governance.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
