{"video_id": "fJuc4-G18nI", "segment_index": 31, "start_seconds": 109.44000244140625, "end_seconds": 112.95999908447266, "text": "and why we appear to be on the verge of getting yet another prime minister.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "fJuc4-G18nI", "segment_index": 32, "start_seconds": 113.5199966430664, "end_seconds": 116.87999725341797, "text": "However, on the flip side of this, those that argue it isn't ungovernable,", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
