{"video_id": "fJuc4-G18nI", "segment_index": 41, "start_seconds": 140.32000732421875, "end_seconds": 145.1199951171875, "text": "So, let's start with structural arguments that demonstrate that Britain really is ungovernable.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "fJuc4-G18nI", "segment_index": 42, "start_seconds": 145.75999450683594, "end_seconds": 149.75999450683594, "text": "The most obvious place to start here is by pointing out that from 2010 onwards,", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
