{"video_id": "fJuc4-G18nI", "segment_index": 50, "start_seconds": 174.8800048828125, "end_seconds": 178.39999389648438, "text": "But the number and scale of the crises of the last 15 years", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "fJuc4-G18nI", "segment_index": 51, "start_seconds": 178.39999389648438, "end_seconds": 182.47999572753906, "text": "has meant that prime ministers have had to spend a lot more of their time dealing with them,", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
